      "title": "Notes",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## FLUX.3 klein 图像编辑·多参考(蒸馏 int8 档)\n\n### 机制\n- 图输入即指令编辑:②组写「要改成什么」;③组参考图经④组 ReferenceMultiLatent 注入(多参考通道,可再挂 LoadImage 扩展参考张数)\n\n### 模型三件 / 来源门禁 / 精度显存 / 引擎版本\n- 同 `flux3-文生图.json`:三件文件名完全一致;官方仓 gated,取 ml-resources 无门禁镜像;int8 convrot 档;8GB 卡 offload 常态(首图分钟级);**ComfyUI ≥ v0.41.1**\n\n### 用法要点\n- 步数可试 4-16;蒸馏档 CFG=1\n- LoadImage 默认为官方示例图名,实弹时选实际输入图;官方示例图(可作首测输入):`https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/refs/heads/main/input/woman_gold_earring_teal_top_portrait.png`\n- 官方模板另有 CreateBoundingBoxes(框选精确编辑)与 EmptyFlux2LatentImage(自定义画幅)演示件,本件未含,可按需自加\n\n### 源流\n- 官方模板 `image_flux3_klein_distilled_image_edit`(Comfy-Org/workflow_templates,ComfyUI v0.41.1 伴版)平迁移改;组框/说明中文化;出图每次换随机种子(seed=randomize)"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## FLUX.3 image-small: editing\n\nSame files and sampler settings as text-to-image (50 steps, cfg 3.5, euler / simple).\n\n**References**: plug more input image to the `Set Reference Multi Latent` node, the first one is `<ref_image_0>` in the prompt, the next `<ref_image_1>`, and so on. Add every reference to **both** the positive and the negative, as the reference pipeline does.\n\n**Size**: the reference is scaled to ~1 MP here and the output latent takes its size. BFL's pipeline keeps references at native size (up to ~16 MP): raise the megapixels for more reference detail at a higher cost.\n\n**Prompting**: write a full caption of the result, with the edit folded in."
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
